{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56901","headline":"抚州民爲千金陂谣（题从《古谣谚》卷八一拟） 二 · 佚名","name":"抚州民爲千金陂谣（题从《古谣谚》卷八一拟） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公作千金，抚民惠深。\n陂水沈沈，乐乎人心。\n我田不荒，我苗如林。\n忧公之去，谁其嗣音？\n（见《全唐文》卷八○五栢虔冉《新创千金陂记》引）（按：据记云：「公指咸通间「抚州刺史渤海李公。\n」郁贤皓先生《唐刺史考》疑李公爲李寂。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}